                                                "sense_id": "52e0748d-e54b-3e1a-b6fa-32664da9a874",
                                                "text": "To provide against this inconvenient, when the Stoikes were demanded whence the election of two indifferent things commeth into our soule[…]they answer, that this motion of the soule is extraorainarie and irregular comming into us by a strange, accidentall and casuall impulsion."
